{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t正籌建本港第三間醫學院的香港科技大學表示，醫學院教研綜合大樓已於上周平頂，在基建規劃、課程發展和師資招聘等方面亦進展良好。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n科大校長葉玉如表示，醫學院不會主動挖角，強調是透過全球公開招聘和遴選機制招聘人才。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:01:19.136477+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T11:44:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:58:37.030437+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T11:58:40.682347+00:00","content_hash":"6a552c4ea9db92da69e3ffa510722cde2adea93e495e15132a8ec83e07f1b2ca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}